\ Fixture for own_module_image_deps. Imports `probe` from module C without
\ defining its own. `a-quot` hands out a stored quotation whose bare `probe`
\ must resolve through this module's serialized import edge, not the
\ colliding export the entry file imported. `a-call` hands out a quotation
\ that calls `a-helper`, a module word the freeze never discovers, so the
\ helper's own body runs interpreted with this module's deps frame pushed.
\ The nested definitions keep the quotation bodies uncompilable, so they run
\ interpreted inside the runtime image.

use { probe: } "./own_module_image_deps_c.1z" ;

a-quot: ( -- q ) [ [ inner: [ probe ] ; inner ] ] ;

a-helper: ( -- str ) [ probe ] ;

a-call: ( -- q ) [ [ inner2: [ a-helper ] ; inner2 ] ] ;
